---
<RentalDetailLayout data={pageData}>
  <p>
    Velcorix is a premier supplier of high-performance industrial hardware, abrasives, fasteners, and workshop tools across the UAE. We provide essential mechanical components engineered to withstand extreme site conditions across heavy construction, manufacturing, marine shipyards, and oil & gas operations.
  </p>
  <p>
    From high-tensile bolts, anchors, and structural clamps to precision cutting wheels, flap discs, and specialty lubricants, our comprehensive inventory guarantees full compliance with international ISO, DIN, and ANSI quality standards. We offer rapid bulk dispatch across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and DIC industrial zones.
  </p>
</RentalDetailLayout>
